# ClassicGuide - Dustwallow Marsh (36-41), Alliance, WoW Classic Era
# Copyright (C) 2026 GREYsaurus (https://github.com/GREYsaurus) - GPL-3.0-only. Original route and notes.
# Written for Classic Era from the Classic quest data: TBCGuide's Dustwallow route was built on quests
# that patch 2.4 added (Mudsprocket, the Theramore revamp), which Classic Era does not have.

@guide A_Dustwallow
@name Dustwallow Marsh (Theramore)
@faction Alliance
@levels 40-41
@zone Dustwallow Marsh
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Theramore Isle and the Shady Rest Inn: the deserters and Lieutenant Paval Reethe, the black shield, Morgan Stern's cooking and the Mirefin murlocs.
@next Both_Tanaris

fp Theramore
bind Theramore [area=513]
accept They Call Him Smiling Jim | Guard Byron, at the Theramore gate.
turnin They Call Him Smiling Jim | Captain Garran Vimes, Foothold Citadel.
accept Mudrock Soup and Bugs | Morgan Stern, by the Theramore docks.
complete Mudrock Soup and Bugs | Mudrock tortoises along the Theramore coast.
turnin Mudrock Soup and Bugs
accept ... and Bugs
note Ride out along the road west to the burned Shady Rest Inn.
accept 1252 Lieutenant Paval Reethe | The guard badge lies in the ruins of the inn.
accept 1253 The Black Shield | The black shield is in the same ruins.
accept 1284 Suspicious Hoofprints | The hoofprints are beside the inn.
complete ... and Bugs | Saltspittle and mire crawlers along the shore.
accept Hungry! | Mudcrush Durtfeet, the friendly giant in the north.
complete Hungry! | Mirefin murlocs on the northern coast.
turnin Hungry!
accept Stinky's Escape [optional] | "Stinky" Ignatz, north of the road. Escort: start it only when you are ready to follow.
complete Stinky's Escape [optional] | Stay close; it fails if he dies.
note [hc=only] | Hardcore: Stinky's escort draws murlocs and crocolisks in waves. Leave it out unless you are 37 or higher and at full health.
accept The Orc Report | The loose dirt beside Swamp Eye Jarl's house.
travel Theramore
turnin 1252 Lieutenant Paval Reethe | Captain Garran Vimes.
turnin 1253 The Black Shield
turnin 1284 Suspicious Hoofprints
turnin The Orc Report | A Theramore lieutenant outside the citadel.
accept Captain Vimes
turnin Captain Vimes
turnin ... and Bugs | Morgan Stern.
turnin Stinky's Escape [optional] | Morgan Stern.
accept 1259 Lieutenant Paval Reethe | Vimes again.
turnin 1259 Lieutenant Paval Reethe | Adjutant Tesoran, in the citadel.
accept Daelin's Men
turnin Daelin's Men | Captain Garran Vimes.
accept 1286 The Deserters
accept 1319 The Black Shield
turnin 1319 The Black Shield | Caz Twosprocket, Theramore.
accept 1320 The Black Shield
turnin 1320 The Black Shield | Captain Garran Vimes.
note [hc=only] | Hardcore: Balos Jacken's deserters camp on the hill south-west of the inn and stand in groups. Pull them apart before you talk to him.
turnin 1286 The Deserters | Balos Jacken, the deserters' camp south-west of the Shady Rest Inn.
accept 1287 The Deserters
complete 1287 The Deserters
turnin 1287 The Deserters | Captain Garran Vimes, Theramore.
level 41 | Kill mudrock tortoises and murlocs on the coast if you are short of 41; Tanaris starts at 41.
train
note Fly from Theramore to Gadgetzan (Tanaris) if you have that flight path; otherwise take the road south through Dustwallow and Thousand Needles.
